# Scope: Configured security perimeter model with NGINX auth_request subrequests (/internal/auth/verify, /internal/auth/verify-student, /internal/auth/verify-admin, /internal/auth/verify-optional) for authentication offloading and downstream identity header injection (X-User-Id, X-User-Role, X-User-Email, X-Session-Id). Strips client-supplied identity headers at the ingress boundary.
